note as PUBLIC_diagram_23_diagnostic_units
  PUBLIC PATIENT PROFILE
  The public projection includes verified identity, sites, specialties,
  practitioners, studies, preparation, turnaround, current public prices,
  accessibility, ratings and booking links. It excludes contracts, internal
  cost, insurer rules, equipment serials, credentials and clinical PHI.
end note

note as PRICE_diagram_23_diagnostic_units
  PRICE RULES
  Prices are append-only versions with effective periods. A published amount
  is never overwritten. Overlapping active prices for the same schedule and
  offering are rejected by a database exclusion constraint.
end note


